+// SDK patch 5 (Gears2-Native): frame traces, ported from Xenia Canary d3d12_shared_memory.cc
+// (BSD-3-Clause), with the download offset advanced per range (Canary rewrites the first range).
+void D3D12SharedMemory::ResetTraceDownload() {
